rows of the exceptional sets:
  N=7: row L_3 position s=1
  N=21: row L_5 position s=2
  N=1: on no row (the root)
  N=11: row L_5 position s=1
  N=13: row L_3 position s=2
  N=47: row L_23 position s=1
  N=67: row L_33 position s=1
Collatz in count coordinates descends a row to its head (s = 1) and multiplies the head by 3:
  N=7 = 1 + 3*2^1: T(N)=21 -> row L_5 s=2; head of L_3 = 7, 3*head = 21 = 1 + 5*2^2
  N=21 = 1 + 5*2^2: T(N)=11 -> row L_5 s=1; head of L_5 = 11, 3*head = 33 = 1 + 1*2^5
  N=13 = 1 + 3*2^2: T(N)=7 -> row L_3 s=1; head of L_3 = 7, 3*head = 21 = 1 + 5*2^2
  N=25 = 1 + 3*2^3: T(N)=13 -> row L_3 s=2; head of L_3 = 7, 3*head = 21 = 1 + 5*2^2
  N=49 = 1 + 3*2^4: T(N)=25 -> row L_3 s=3; head of L_3 = 7, 3*head = 21 = 1 + 5*2^2
row index map c -> oddpart(3c+1) is the Syracuse map: [(1, 1), (3, 5), (5, 1), (7, 11), (9, 7), (11, 17), (23, 35), (33, 25)]
conjugacy check (x -> h = 2x+1) for x <= 2000: True True
3q+2 = 3(q+1)-1 and 3q+4 = 3(q+1)+1 for odd q: the 3y-1 and 3y+1 images of the even number y = q+1;
in count coordinates the children 3q (digit 0), 3q+2, 3q+4 and the two famous steps 3q (Collatz) and 3q-4 (3x-1) are 3q + 2*sigma with sigma = 0, 1, 2 and 0, -2;
in half-counts x = (q-1)/2 the three children are x -> 3x+1 (Collatz odd step), 3x+2, 3x+3 = 3(x+1): True
row of 3q+2 is L_{oddpart(3q+1)} = L_{syr(q)} (the Syracuse image of q!); row of 3q+4 is L_{3 * oddpart(q+1)}; row of 3q is L_{oddpart(3q-1)}:
  q=3: 3q+2=11 in L_5 (syr(q)=5), 3q+4=13 in L_3, 3q=9 in L_1
  q=5: 3q+2=17 in L_1 (syr(q)=1), 3q+4=19 in L_9, 3q=15 in L_7
  q=7: 3q+2=23 in L_11 (syr(q)=11), 3q+4=25 in L_3, 3q=21 in L_5
  q=9: 3q+2=29 in L_7 (syr(q)=7), 3q+4=31 in L_15, 3q=27 in L_13
  q=11: 3q+2=35 in L_17 (syr(q)=17), 3q+4=37 in L_9, 3q=33 in L_1
  q=13: 3q+2=41 in L_5 (syr(q)=5), 3q+4=43 in L_21, 3q=39 in L_19
  q=15: 3q+2=47 in L_23 (syr(q)=23), 3q+4=49 in L_3, 3q=45 in L_11
  q=17: 3q+2=53 in L_13 (syr(q)=13), 3q+4=55 in L_27, 3q=51 in L_25
so the digit-1 child of q sits on the row of the Syracuse image of q, at height v_2(3q+1).
